cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you report on these changes or reuse the data, please cite fineprint."
title: "fineprint: a dated, diffable archive of AI vendor pricing, limits and terms"
abstract: >-
  Snapshots of 46 public pricing, rate-limit, usage-policy, terms, privacy,
  deprecation and changelog pages from 10 AI vendors, committed to git on
  every change. History from May 2026 is rebuilt from weekly Wayback Machine
  captures. Each change has a one-line summary that links to the raw diff.
type: dataset
authors:
  - alias: dadwritestech
repository-code: "https://github.com/dadwritestech/fineprint"
url: "https://dadwritestech.github.io/fineprint/"
license: CC-BY-4.0
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-11-05"
keywords:
  - terms of service
  - pricing
  - LLM
  - AI policy
  - web archive
